{%- comment -%}
  Snippet: curvjeans-returns-exchanges-preface (NO parse_json)

  Usage:
    {% render 'curvjeans-returns-exchanges-preface',
      portal_url: 'https://curvjeans.returnista.com/',
      return_label_cost: '€6.95'
    %}

  - Auto language EN/NL/DE via request.locale.iso_code (fallback EN)
  - Soft selection logic + adaptive CTA copy
  - Namespaced classes to avoid interference
  - Adds Klarna pre-frame banner (reduce Klarna disputes / invoice anxiety)
  - Updated structure:
      Header
      "How it works" as clean headline + inline steps (no big bordered box)
      Klarna banner BELOW "How it works" and ABOVE cards
      Cohesive spacing system (desktop + mobile)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign cjrx_portal_url = portal_url | default: "https://curvjeans.returnista.com/" -%}
{%- assign cjrx_return_label_cost = return_label_cost | default: "" -%}
